WEBVTT

v01
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.540
Every family has one person who knows all the stories.

v02
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:05.100
How she met Walter.

v05
00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:07.239
None of it is written down.

v06
00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:10.479
We all mean to ask. Then life gets busy.

v07
00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.096
A Story calls her.

v09
00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:17.020
<v A Story>Who did you meet by pure chance who changed your life?

v10
00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:19.766
She just talks. She never types.

v09b
00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:22.070
<v A Story>Did you know where they came from?

v11
00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:25.599
Every answer becomes a memory, in her own words.

v12
00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:28.488
The whole family adds what they remember.

v13
00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:32.658
And whenever you're ready, it becomes a book you can hold.

v14
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.522
Grandma gets a call she looks forward to.

v15
00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:39.743
The family hears stories they've never heard.

v16
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:43.490
And her stories become a book the whole family keeps.

v17
00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:47.134
A Story. Your family's living memories.
